nsumers  enjoy google products they're often free  and they choose them when given a choice  they these are products that innovate  rapidly  google agrees calling the lawsuit deeply  flawed  if this case is correct it will make it  harder for consumers potentially to  access google  to access a search service that they  love and they choose to use  and tonight fox news obtains a memo from  ceo sundar pachai to employees telling  them to ignore the noise  and stay deeply focused on their mission  tonight tech insiders are telling us the  future of this lawsuit  does not hinge on the outcome of the  presidential election it is going  forward full steam ahead regardless of  who's in the oval office come january  20th now it  is true that reigning in big tech has  become a truly bipartisan issue here in  washington over the last couple of years  so it seems brett  google is finally facing a reckoning  brett julian turner live outside doj  jillian thanks also breaking
 

